WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
Babylonia, the twelfth year of exile.

2
00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:07.120
A man who has escaped from
Jerusalem arrives with news.

3
00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:11.220
The evening before,
Ezekiel's long silence ends.

4
00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:14.410
The news: the city has been defeated.

5
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:19.460
The exiles say: our bones are
dried up, and our hope is lost.

6
00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:23.340
When the Temple is gone and the
people say their hope is lost,

7
00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.650
what can a prophet still promise?

8
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:29.830
In this mission, you'll stand in
a valley full of very dry bones,

9
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:33.070
and hear a question: can these bones live?

10
00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:35.620
Then you'll follow a
river from a new Temple,

11
00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:39.400
ankle deep, then knee
deep, towards the Dead Sea.

12
00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:44.090
Your mission: find out what Ezekiel could
still promise when the Temple was gone

13
00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:45.870
and hope seemed lost.
